The data this plugin reads are Ginnie Mae's mortgage-backed securities
disclosures, which it publishes to signed-in users of its Disclosure Data
Download under its terms of use. The files under tests/responses/ are Ginnie
Mae's published samples of its factor and REMIC factor file layouts. This
project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Ginnie Mae.
